{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281080","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1028108001:0":{"text":"몬스터를 물리쳤어요! 휴윈 양, 마력을 계속 흡수할 수 있겠어요? 중단되었다고 지장을 받진 않겠죠?","source_cn":"魔物解决啦！伊温小姐，你还能继续吸收魔力吗，不会因为中...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9031066F1723AEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028108002:0":{"text":"네, 괜찮아요...","source_cn":"嗯，没关系……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1A9C9A8BB67C7FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028108003:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 부탁드려요...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD2583D3EF16A6D60","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 부탁드려요...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 부탁드려요...","variant_male_record_index":"110714","variant_female_record_index":"110715","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1028108003":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 부탁드려요...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，麻烦你了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD2583D3EF16A6D60","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 부탁드려요...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 부탁드려요...","variant_male_record_index":"110714","variant_female_record_index":"110715","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028108004:0":{"text":"왜 그러니, 얘야? 슬퍼 보이는구나.","source_cn":"怎么啦，孩子？你看起来很难过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3680E11BD2E45CAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028108005:0":{"text":"누... 누구세요? ","source_cn":"是……是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6291A195EFDA718","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028108006:0":{"text":"겁내지 말거라. 왜 그러니? 누가 괴롭혔니?","source_cn":"孩子，别害怕。你怎么了，有谁欺负你了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEABA4F3EF0FC54A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028108007:0":{"text":"괴롭히지 않았어요... 저, 저는...","source_cn":"没有欺负……我、我不是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41A8C0AF9AD2E583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028108008:0":{"text":"너무 슬퍼 보이는구나. 힘든 일이라도 있었니? 얘야, 속상하면 혼자 끙끙대지 말고 말을 하려무나.","source_cn":"你看着伤心得很，唉，是不是受了什么委屈。孩子，要是心里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52273CC25F0C207A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028108009:0":{"text":"저... 저는... ","source_cn":"我……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD3B1462D53D41FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028108010:0":{"text":"말하기 싫으면 한바탕 울어도 된단다. 울면 조금 괜찮아지거든.","source_cn":"你要是不想说呀，那就大哭上一场，哭出来就能好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BE0FF1A0CA3C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028108011:0":{"text":"무서워요...","source_cn":"我怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x464913F6C9A1C2E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028108012:0":{"text":"괜찮아, 괜찮아. 울어도 된단다. 누구든 안 울어봤겠니? 나 같은 할머니도 슬플 때가 있단다! 우는 게 뭐 어때서?","source_cn":"不怕、不怕，哭就哭了，谁还没哭过？哪怕长到我这么大岁数...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40950B4DBD810AF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028108013:0":{"text":"저는... 흑.... 흐윽...","source_cn":"我……呜、呜呜……呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE5AB92BCE14F73E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:1028108014:0":{"text":"휴윈은 울음을 터뜨렸고, 눈물이 흐르자 마법처럼 하늘에서 비가 내리기 시작했다.","source_cn":"伊温哭泣出声，她的泪水划过脸庞，天空中的雨滴也魔法般地落下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3105320AC3BFECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1028108015:2":{"text":"비가 오네. 비 맞기 전에 빨리 집으로 돌아가자.","source_cn":"下雨了，我们先回屋，你不能淋雨的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31DA1CF3BEA98ED5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1028108016:0":{"text":"잠깐만... 여보, 비를 맞으니 몸이 편안하고 따뜻해... 조금 기운이 나는 것 같아.","source_cn":"等等……亲爱的，这雨淋在身上很舒服，很温暖……我好像有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF20F96704DF6E006","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1028108017:0":{"text":"안색이 좀 좋아진 거 같은데, 진짜 괜찮아? 어디 봐봐... 당, 당신 손도 전처럼 차갑지 않아!","source_cn":"你的脸色红润了些，真的好点了吗？让我看看……你、你的手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x305092F3EAE966BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1028108018:0":{"text":"미샤르테께서 우리 기도를 들으셨나 봐. 정말 다행이다. 이 비는... 이 비는 분명 신께서 내린 이슬일 거야!","source_cn":"一定是弥萨忒听到了我们的祈求。太好了，这雨……这雨一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99DF011CECCDB7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1028108019:0":{"text":"...이게 내 힘인가? 이 빗방울들이...","source_cn":"……这是，我释放出的力量吗？这些雨水……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5183E060034FD12A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","